1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
一碗面，五种颜色缺一不算正宗
Five colors — or it's not the real bowl

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
一清：牛骨汤熬到透亮
One clear: bone broth, cooked crystal-clear

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
二白：萝卜片，白如玉
Two white: radish, pale as jade

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
三红：一勺辣子油泼下去
Three red: a ladle of chili oil

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
四绿：香菜蒜苗撒满面
Four green: cilantro and garlic sprout

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
五黄：面条黄亮又筋道
Five yellow: noodles bright and springy

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
一块面团，师傅手里说变就变
One dough — the master bends it at will

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
毛细、韭叶、大宽…十几种粗细
Fine, leaf, wide — a dozen widths

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
这手拉面，是国家级非遗
This hand-pulling is national heritage

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
汤清，才是一碗面的功夫
A clear broth — that's the real skill

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,400
你吃几细？下集：一碗不要汤的面
Your width? Next: a noodle with no soup
